OL,3,GNEWSARayner to rule on landmark green
OL,4,Abelt appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fate of a controversial plan for
OL,7,F800 homes on green belt land near a
OL,8,FShropshire village will be decided by
OL,9,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner in a
OL,10,Fcase campaigners say could test
OL,11,FLabour's planning reforms.
OL,13,FA 12-day appeal is underway into
OL,14,Fwhether Boningale Homes should be
OL,15,Fallowed to build the estate south of
OL,16,FAlbrighton after Shropshire Council
OL,17,Frejected the application.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
