OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1789669104
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSARayner to rule on landmark green
OL,4,Abelt appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FInstead of being determined by the
OL,7,Fplanning inspector overseeing the
OL,8,Fappeal, the government told the council
OL,9,Fon Wednesday that Rayner would make the
OL,10,Ffinal decision.
OL,12,FA letter sent on her behalf said the
OL,13,Fappeal raised "important or novel
OL,14,Fissues" and involved "significant
OL,15,Fdevelopment in the green belt".
